name fancypar
category Package
revision 58895
shortdesc Decoration of individual paragraphs
longdesc Decorates individual paragraphs of a document, offering five
longdesc pre-defined styles. The command offers an optional 'key-value'
longdesc argument with the user may define parameters of the selected
longdesc style. Predefined styles offer a spiral-notebook, a zebra-like,
longdesc a dashed, a marked design, and an underlined style. Users may
longdesc also define their own styles. Decorated paragraphs may not
longdesc include displayed mathematics.
